      "content": "Actually, the engineers are a bit worried about the specific heavy metal filtration protocols during monsoon season. The new model is a generalist, so it might not have the same fine-tuned sensitivity to the rapid pH shifts we see during heavy rain. We're hoping it'll be fine, but there's a chance it won't catch the subtle fluctuations like you do.",
